Upstream data, which is NOT ours and which we do not relicense
==============================================================

We redistribute figures derived from public registers. The source data belongs
to the bodies that publish it, under the licences those bodies set. Attribution
below is required of anyone reusing this project's output.

  IMPIC, contratos publicos (Portal BASE), via dados.gov.pt
    The authoritative record: the contracts, the buyers, the suppliers.
    Licence: see the dataset page on dados.gov.pt. CONFIRM BEFORE RELYING ON IT.

  apiaberta (Portal BASE mirror)
    A lossy six-field mirror, used only for deltas between bulk refreshes.
    Licence: see the API terms. CONFIRM BEFORE RELYING ON IT.

  SICAE, Sistema de Informacao da Classificacao Portuguesa de Actividades
    Economicas
    Company activity classification, queried per NIF.

  VIES, VAT Information Exchange System (European Commission)
    Registered address and VAT validity, queried per NIF.

We do not correct the upstream record. Anything wrong or missing there appears
here unchanged, by design. Corrections belong with the publishing body, not
with us.
